          "text": "Njalo ngizayilahla inzalo kaJakobe lenceku yami uDavida, ukuze ngingathathi loyedwa wenzalo yakhe abe ngumbusi phezu kwenzalo kaAbrahama, uIsaka loJakobe; ngoba ngizabuyisela ukuthunjwa kwabo lesihawu phezu kwabo.",
